### Crawler ingest (push crawled news back to backend)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/internal/crawler/news/batchUpsert
# X-Crawler-Token: your_shared_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "taskId": 1,
      "title": "Demo News Title",
      "content": "Demo content...",
      "url": "https://example.com/news/1",
      "source": "example",
      "publishTime": "2026-01-29 12:34:56"
    }
  ]
}
